# First blessing approved by the maintainer on 2026-10-05 for #134.
# Chapter 6 queues error as a separate message after the failed Run's records.
# Chapter 5 keeps FIFO order and suppresses Guard errors. During is bound before
# testing each clause. Chapter 8 charges dispatch, even for skipped clauses.
# The first Pump ends just after throw: clause 4 + const 1 + throw 10 + unwind 4.
# The retained error message is 32 + size(error); during is metadata, not an arg.

